# Trust Zones

<!-- merged from: atlas/04-atlas-trust-zones -->

- Zone 1: Auth Proxy — authentication, licensing, request headers.
- Zone 2: Experiences — UI only; calls FHIR API only.
- Zone 3: Platform services — business logic.
- Zone 4: Data — Neo4j, Redis, Blob, Service Bus.
- Zone 5: AI — MHRA boundary; Azure OpenAI / other models.
- Zone 6: Integration — HL7 / FHIR / Spine connectors.

## Rules

- Zone 2 **never** touches the database or AI directly.
- Zone 3 is the only zone that talks to Zone 4 and Zone 5.
- Zone 3 → Zone 5 requires `X-Service-Token`.
